## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a real-time, privacy-conscious AR avatar pipeline that runs on edge hardware with strict latency, and to handle on-device adaptation for user-specific appearance changes.

## Key Concepts

- Monocular depth/pose estimation paired with 3D avatar mesh
- Temporal fusion and occlusion handling
- Lightweight on-device adaptation (5-shot) via meta-learning
- Privacy-preserving processing in conferencing apps
- Edge latency, memory trade-offs, differentiable rendering

